<!-- /wp:wd/button --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/column -->

<!-- wp:wd/column {"blockId":"bc579f6b-fd74-4f0b-9acc-08236131643d","blockVersion":"2","adjacentCount":2,"colWidth":60} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-column wd-bc579f6b"><!-- wp:wd/accordion {"blockId":"ffac12e4-7aee-4783-962e-147660939790","blockVersion":"2","allClosed":true,"openerIcon":"plus","titleTpFontFamily":"var(\u002d\u002dwd-title-font)","titleTpFontVariant":"600","titleTpFontWeight":"600"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion wd-accordion wd-style-default wd-titles-start wd-opener-style-plus wd-opener-pos-end wd-ffac12e4" data-state="all"><!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"236657e5-01e1-441f-a5e0-06decae26d2c","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderWidthBottom":"1","borderWidthLock":false} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-236657e5"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Why choose organic cotton fabrics and certified factories?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"692b8920-0f94-4b71-bc05-4c130f93b2fb","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-692b8920">A seemingly elegant design can quickly begin to bloat with unexpected content or break under the weight of actual activity. Fake data can ensure a nice looking layout but it doesn’t reflect what a living, breathing application must endure. Real data does.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"440ed28c-95c1-4e0c-8c9d-4b13f62c75be","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-440ed28c"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>How is your product packaged?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"c7b91955-8ada-446a-ae47-73e3a7a35d9c","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-c7b91955">Websites in professional use templating systems. Commercial publishing platforms and content management systems ensure that you can show different text, different data using the same template. When it’s about controlling hundreds of articles, product pages for web shops.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"08a0c663-1fc1-45f7-9e8b-2b58ffc771f4","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"none"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-08a0c663"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What’s the best size to buy for a baby shower gift?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"25bc952a-4875-4a36-b4b1-72fa3f9b2b55","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-25bc952a">If the copy becomes distracting in the design then you are doing something wrong or they are discussing copy changes. It might be a bit annoying but you could tell them that that discussion would be best suited for another time. At worst the discussion is at least working towards the final goal of your site where questions about lorem ipsum don’t.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/column --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/row -->

